<resources>
  <!-- Why an operation failed: the user data service or auth service couldn't be reached. -->
  <string name="app_error_network">ບໍ່ສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້. ກວດສອບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອິນເຕີເນັດ ແລ້ວລອງໃໝ່.</string>
  <!-- Why an operation failed: the user's session has expired. -->
  <string name="app_error_unauthenticated">ເຊດຊັນຂອງທ່ານໝົດອາຍຸແລ້ວ. ກະລຸນາເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃໝ່.</string>
  <!-- Why an operation failed: the signed-in user isn't allowed to do it. -->
  <string name="app_error_permission_denied">ທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້.</string>
  <!-- Why an operation failed: what it refers to was deleted. -->
  <string name="app_error_not_found">ລາຍການນີ້ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ.</string>
  <!-- Why an operation failed: someone changed the same thing at the same time. -->
  <string name="app_error_conflict">ລາຍການນີ້ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງຢູ່ບ່ອນອື່ນ. ລອງໃໝ່.</string>
  <!-- Why an operation failed: what it changes no longer accepts changes, e.g. a closed or archived survey; retrying won't help. -->
  <string name="app_error_not_editable">ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນແປງລາຍການນີ້ໄດ້ໃນຕອນນີ້. ແບບສຳຫຼວດອາດຖືກປິດ ຫຼື ເກັບເຂົ້າແຟ້ມແລ້ວ.</string>
  <!-- Why an operation failed: the server rejected what was entered. -->
  <string name="app_error_validation">ຂໍ້ມູນບາງສ່ວນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ. ກວດສອບ ແລ້ວລອງໃໝ່.</string>
  <!-- Why an operation failed: a quota or rate limit was reached. -->
  <string name="app_error_quota_exceeded">ທ່ານໃຊ້ງານຮອດຂີດຈຳກັດແລ້ວ. ລອງໃໝ່ພາຍຫຼັງ.</string>
  <!-- Why an operation failed: the user cancelled it. -->
  <string name="app_error_cancelled">ຍົກເລີກແລ້ວ.</string>
  <!-- Why an operation failed, when there is no more specific reason. -->
  <string name="app_error_unknown">ມີບາງຢ່າງຜິດພາດ. ລອງໃໝ່.</string>
  <!-- Notice after sign-in fails. %1$s = why, one of the app_error_* sentences. -->
  <string name="app_sign_in_failed">ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໄດ້. %1$s</string>
</resources>
